        "foo/fii-test": "1.6.1.*",
        "faa/feee":"3.0.0",
    }
}
```
 Install composer binary on your system Execute composer from within the root of your plugin this should download stuff into [yourplugindir]/vendor That's it. You ship the json and vendor dir with your plugin. Whenever you need to use some of the libraries just provide the include like this: 
```text
require_once($CFG->
dirroot
 . '/path/to/module/vendor/autoload.php');
